									"minProperties": 1,
									"description": "Partial properties of paragraph/heading/list-item blocks. Distances in points; omitted properties stay unchanged. Tabs replace stops; border sides patch independently; null removes a side. Shading is an explicit RGB fill. Distances are points, never twips: 1 inch = 72 pt; half an inch = 36 pt."
